ounty&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those years, more than any other pair. This year so far, February to March sat at 7% of normal in 2026 on the middle, and March to April at 20% in 2026. Grid 22323 had its driest year in 1956 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
